==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|pleintif}}, {{m|enm|plentyff}}, from {{der|en|fr|plaintif|t=aggrieved, lamenting}}, from {{m|fro|plainte|t=lament, complaint}}; see [[plaint]]. {{doublet|en|plaintiff}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpleɪntɪv/|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Sounding [[sorrowful]], [[mournful]] or [[melancholic]].
#: {{ux|en|a typically '''plaintive''' song from Radiohead}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|plaint}}
* {{l|en|plaintiff}}

